DTSTART:20260822T010000Z
DTEND:20260822T025000Z
DTSTAMP:20260822T010000Z
UID:1kuYSjeSdl
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 94 mins (1h34m)\n\nA rare 35mm print of this 2001 sp
 ace western musical. Samuel Curtis\, an interplanetary trader\, sets forth
  through a rustic and remote solar system\, unaware that his old friend Pr
 ofessor Hess is trying to kill him.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-thea
 ters/the-american-astronaut\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
